The '''Rusty Spur''' is an [[Artifacts|Artifact]] that can be found by digging up an [[Artifact Spot]] on [[The Farm]], or in [[Fishing#Treasure Chests|Fishing Treasure Chests]] or [[Artifact Trove]]s. It can also be gifted by a [[Animals#Pets|pet]] dog with max [[Animals#Friendship|friendship]].

==Donation==
Donation of this item contributes to the total count of donations for the [[Museum]].

